          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "తేల్చు (tēlcu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 3464 lists Telugu tēlucu, \"to cause to float\", beside tēlu, \"to float\"; in everyday Telugu it means to settle a matter."
